```
Check positions: row 7 = 49-55. hitler at 50,52,54; goebbels 49,51,53; himmler 46 (row6 last), 47? Wait row 6 indices 42-48. 46,47,48 are row 6. Good. Distinct.

highest: hitler 2, goebbels 2, himmler 2.
facts empty.
nextEvent 70.
seenEvents [].
buffs zeros.
